@startuml
title "MyNotes Application - Complete Sequence Flows"

actor User
participant "MainActivity" as Main
participant "NavigationViewModel" as NavVM
participant "SignInViewModel" as SignVM
participant "NotesListViewModel" as ListVM
participant "NoteViewModel" as NoteVM
participant "NotesRepository" as Repo
participant "NoteDao" as DAO
participant "FirebaseAuth" as Auth
participant "Firestore" as Firebase

== Authentication Flow ==
User -> Main: Launch App
Main -> NavVM: checkUserAuth()
NavVM -> Auth: getCurrentUser()
Auth --> NavVM: null (not authenticated)
NavVM --> Main: NavigationState.Ready(SignInScreen)
Main --> User: Show SignIn Screen

User -> SignVM: Click "Sign In with Google"
SignVM -> Auth: signInWithCredential()
Auth --> SignVM: Success
SignVM -> NavVM: User authenticated
NavVM --> Main: Navigate to NotesListScreen

== Notes List Flow ==
Main -> ListVM: Initialize
ListVM -> Repo: getNotesFlow()
Repo -> DAO: getAllNotesFlow()
DAO --> Repo: Flow<List<NoteEntity>>
Repo -> Firebase: setupRealtimeSync()
Firebase --> Repo: Real-time updates
Repo --> ListVM: Flow<List<Note>>
ListVM --> User: Display notes list

User -> ListVM: Click "Add Note"
ListVM -> Repo: addNote()
Repo -> DAO: upsertNote(newNote)
DAO --> Repo: Success
Repo -> Firebase: Add document
Firebase --> Repo: Success
Repo --> ListVM: Note added
ListVM --> User: Navigate to NoteScreen

== Note Details Flow ==
User -> NoteVM: Open note for editing
NoteVM -> Repo: getNoteById(noteId)
Repo -> DAO: getNoteById(noteId)
DAO --> Repo: NoteEntity
Repo --> NoteVM: Note
NoteVM --> User: Display note content

User -> NoteVM: Edit note content
User -> NoteVM: Save changes
NoteVM -> Repo: updateNote(updatedNote)
Repo -> DAO: upsertNote(updatedNote)
DAO --> Repo: Success
Repo -> Firebase: Update document
Firebase --> Repo: Success
Repo --> NoteVM: Note updated
NoteVM --> User: Show success, navigate back

== Offline Scenario ==
User -> NoteVM: Edit note (offline)
NoteVM -> Repo: updateNote(note)
Repo -> DAO: upsertNote(note)
DAO --> Repo: Success (local only)
Repo -x Firebase: Network unavailable
Repo --> NoteVM: Saved locally

note over Firebase: When network restored
Firebase -> Repo: Sync pending changes
Repo -> Firebase: Update document
Firebase --> Repo: Sync complete

@enduml
